// "<agent> creates N <token>" [CR#701.7a]: the creating spell or ability
// defines the token's characteristics [CR#111.3,111.4]. Lean `create`.
//
// STOP (updated by `semantics-v2-macro-param-kinds`): the token argument
// needs a `TokenSpec` (or `CharacteristicBundle`) param type.
// `deckmaste_semantics_v2::ron::param_types()` now has one (`TokenSpec`,
// this ticket's crate fix), but `deckmaste_construction_core::macro_def::
// ParameterType` — the SAME closed eight-name enum, mirrored independently
// on the english_v2/typed side that reads every `plugins_v2` declaration's
// `params:` field too (§11: neither crate depends on the other for the
// shared declaration file, so BOTH readers must accept a param type before
// any declaration can use it) — has no `TokenSpec` variant and was out of
// this ticket's authorized file scope. A one-sided fix is unusable
// (`both_readers_accept_every_builtin_declaration` fails from the
// construction_core side alone). Left bodyless pending that companion fix.
KeywordAction(
    name: "Create",
    spelling: "create",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "create",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
)
